## Part 6. What you can honestly claim

- Trained a convolutional neural network to forecast the El Niño index from tropical Pacific ocean temperature maps, evaluated against a persistence baseline across forecast lead times.
- Deployed the trained model as a serverless inference endpoint on AWS Lambda behind API Gateway, with data and model artifacts in S3.
- Built an interactive map that translates the forecast into plain language regional winter impacts with an honest per region confidence measure.

Do not claim skill you did not measure, and do not hide the leads where persistence wins. The honesty is the point.

